This version includes:

Airway network using NetworkX
Wind field model (headwind/tailwind effects)
Aircraft mass-dependent fuel burn
PSO route optimization (pyswarms)
Optuna hyperparameter tuning
DEAP NSGA-II multi-objective optimization
Monte Carlo weather uncertainty
Route visualization
Pareto front visualization

Next improvements:
Real airway data (OpenSky, Eurocontrol, FAA/NATS datasets)
Aircraft-specific performance (A320/B787 fuel curves)
Altitude as a decision variable
Time-dependent winds from NOAA/ECMWF weather grids
Pyomo + Gurobi benchmark against the heuristic solutions
Statistical comparison tables (runtime, fuel, emissions, robustness)

